<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Metzler said started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Metzler said started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette initiated coverage of Metzler Group Inc with a buy rating, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 1/16 at 23-1/4.</p>
